<translate>
==== UseWhileEquipped ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If true, the drainable item's charge is spent when activated and equipped.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
UseWhileEquipped = false,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

